# EAS Build project archive excludes. When this file exists, EAS uses ONLY
# these rules (does not merge with .gitignore) — so this must cover
# everything, not just what git already ignores.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.metro-health-check*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
*.pem
.env
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# Native build output — regenerated by prebuild, must never be uploaded
# (Windows file locks on native .so/.o intermediates crash the EAS tarball
# step, e.g. "EBUSY: resource busy or locked ... android/.gradle/
# checksums.lock" while a local Gradle build holds the file).
#
# NOT anchored with a leading slash: EAS clones from the REPO ROOT in this
# monorepo, so "/android" resolved to C:\Projects\PaMarket\android (the
# retired Capacitor folder) and left apps/mobile/android being uploaded.
# Unanchored patterns match the folder at any depth, which is what's wanted
# here — every android/ and ios/ folder in the tree is generated output.
android/
ios/
